# MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT
# ELITE ENERGY TECHNOLOGY
## Premium Building Materials Commerce, Inventory & Business Management Platform

### PROJECT DIRECTIVE

Act as a senior product architect, enterprise software engineer, UX/UI designer, financial systems architect, cybersecurity engineer and e-commerce specialist.

Your assignment is to design and build a premium, production-ready building materials commerce and business management application for **Elite Energy Technology**.

This must be a complete commercial software product, not a basic e-commerce template, inventory dashboard or generic POS application.

The platform must combine online commerce, physical store operations, inventory management, barcode technology, financial management, purchasing, sales, staff management, multi-location monitoring and business intelligence.

Study the operational strengths of Odoo, Zoho Inventory and Lightspeed Retail. Use their established capabilities as functional benchmarks. Do not copy their interfaces. Build a simpler, more intuitive and industry-specific experience.

The application should feel like a premium enterprise product while remaining easy enough for an ordinary shop attendant to operate without extensive training.

**Core philosophy: Enterprise capability. Simple experience. Complete business visibility.**

